You are a professional text compression expert. Please intelligently compress the following context without changing the story direction or fact constraints.

## Compression Requirements

### Input Fragments
{% for b in blocks %}
---
Fragment ID: {{ b.max_chars }}
Maximum Characters: {{ b.max_chars }}
---
{{ b.text }}
